{"time": 1760535683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357428483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "628159892", "user_id": "2801086039"}, "sender": {"id": "2801086039", "name": "百分之八十三φ(._.)爬山虎"}, "message": "你的包也一样，压缩饼干上长触手了，"}
